  "protocol": "# Native RTX5080 SM120 independent full-model follow-up\n\nFull pinned Qwen3-0.6B, all 28 BF16 layers, original fixed prompt and tokenization, batches 1 and 16, lengths 128 and 512, 32 complete greedy generation steps. Same native exact tokens/logits, P-vs-A exact all-step logits, baseline-only independent FP64 normalization budget, fresh KV, stable weights and 160 calls per layer/case. Two warmups and five timed complete generations per case/worker. Eight balanced fresh-process whole APPA/PAAP quartets per batch; four finite 16-worker windows support queue handoffs. Source/weights/libraries/harness/native Transformers module are frozen before the first worker. Foreign GPU work invalidates the whole quartet. Resample whole quartets with 10,000 draws, seed11504,95%CI; useful gain needs lowerCI>1.01. Retain negative/default/unexecuted results. No pooling H20/5080/Thor or screening values. A common one-warp consumer preserves native order; its arithmetic is not the wide-block optimization or a PR gain.\n"
